  "releaseNotes": "## v3.17.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.16.0:\n\n- Ask the three-way menu choice as part of the click's own condition [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Merge main, settling the right-click between the pin and node menus ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- style(test): assert the absence with DoesNotContain [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- style(test): take the assertion Sonar names for the new test [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Offer a pin's own menu on right-click (closes #35) [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
